[114.307, "o", "\u001b[2m    1\u2192# Punchlist Format\r\n         2\u2192\r\n         3\u2192## Item Template\r\n         4\u2192\r\n         5\u2192````markdown\r\n         6\u2192### BH-{NNN}: {title}\r\n         7\u2192**Severity:** CRITICAL | HIGH | MEDIUM | LOW\r\n         8\u2192**Category:** {from taxonomy below}\r\n         9\u2192**Location:** `path/to/file.py:NN`\r\n        10\u2192**Status:** OPEN | IN PROGRESS | RESOLVED | DEFERRED\r\n        11\u2192**Pattern:** {PAT-NNN if applicable}\r\n        12\u2192**Determinism:** {deterministic | intermittent | theoretical} \u2190 bug/* categories only, optional for others\r\n        13\u2192**Investigation:** {`docs/holtz/investigations/BH-{NNN}.md` if complex, omit if straightforward}\r\n        14\u2192**Lens:** {component | integration | security | error-propagation | data-flow | contract \u2014 which analytical lens discovered this finding, optional}\r\n        15\u2192**Predicted:** {Prediction N (confidence: HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW) \u2014 if this finding matched a prediction from 0h-predictions.md, optional}\r\n    \u001b[2m    ... (89 more lines)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
