[218.482, "o", "\u001b[2m    1\u2192# Holtz Punchlist\r\n         2\u2192> Generated: 2026-03-24 | Project: holtz | Baseline: 321 pass, 0 fail, 0 skip\r\n         3\u2192\r\n         4\u2192## Summary\r\n         5\u2192| Severity | Open | Resolved | Deferred |\r\n         6\u2192|----------|------|----------|----------|\r\n         7\u2192| MEDIUM   | 3    | 0        | 0        |\r\n         8\u2192| LOW      | 2    | 0        | 0        |\r\n         9\u2192\r\n        10\u2192## Patterns\r\n        11\u2192\r\n        12\u2192## Items\r\n        13\u2192\r\n        14\u2192### BJ-001: README \"8,500 lines\" claim is ambiguous and unvalidated\r\n        15\u2192**Severity:** MEDIUM\r\n    \u001b[2m    ... (134 more lines)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
