[242.707, "o", "\u001b[2m    1\u2192# Phase 4: Fix Loop (TDD) \u2014 Detailed Procedures\r\n         2\u2192\r\n         3\u2192Read this file at the start of Phase 4. This file is shared by Holtz and Justine \u2014 the fix process is disciplined regardless of how findings were discovered.\r\n         4\u2192\r\n         5\u2192## Triage Flowchart\r\n         6\u2192\r\n         7\u2192```dot\r\n         8\u2192digraph {\r\n         9\u2192  rankdir=TB\r\n        10\u2192  node [shape=box]\r\n        11\u2192  read [label=\"Re-read worklist\\n(MERGED if exists,\\notherwise PUNCHLIST)\"]\r\n        12\u2192  triage [label=\"Triage item\\nby category\"]\r\n        13\u2192  fast [label=\"Fast Path\\n(test\u2192fix\u2192commit)\"]\r\n        14\u2192  investigate [label=\"Investigation Path\\n(layers\u2192confidence\u2192fix)\"]\r\n        15\u2192  cantrepro [label=\"Can't-Reproduce Path\\n(widen\u2192bisect\u2192defer)\"]\r\n    \u001b[2m    ... (25 more lines)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
